  "profilePrivacyPolicyScreenTitle": "PRIVACY POLICY",
  "profilePrivacyPolicyIntroductionTitle": "Introduction",
  "profilePrivacyPolicyIntroductionPara1": "This policy explains what data Nexus JDR collects, why, who it's shared with, and how you can access, export or delete it.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection1Title": "1. Who is responsible for your data",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection1Para1": "This policy applies to the Nexus JDR — Personnages mobile app (Android) and to the Nexus JDR \"Histoires\" web app (nexus-jdr.app), which share the same account.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection1Para2": "Data controller: Matthias Benoit, publisher of Nexus JDR. Contact: support@nexus-jdr.app.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection2Title": "2. Data we collect",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection2Para1": "• Account: email address and password (the password is stored encrypted by our authentication service, we never see it), displayed nickname and optional avatar.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection2Para2": "• Game content: everything you create — characters (stats, skills, spells, inventory, appearance, backstory), journal, group notes, groups and stories you've joined, character files you import.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection2Para3": "• Photos: character portrait, gallery and avatar — only images you choose to take with the camera, import from your gallery, or from a web address.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection2Para4": "• Voice dictation (group notes, optional): the microphone is only used while you're dictating. Speech recognition is handled by your phone's own service (for example Google on Android); we only receive the resulting text, never the audio recording.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection2Para5": "• Notifications: a technical identifier for your device (notification token) and your notification preferences, to send you reminders and news about your groups.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection2Para6": "• Usage statistics: screens viewed and actions taken in the app, along with technical information (device model, system, app version) and a pseudonymous identifier generated by the measurement tool. These statistics are not linked to your account or your email address.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection2Para7": "• Bug reports: title, description and severity you enter, app version, platform and, if you choose, the character involved.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection3Title": "3. What we don't collect",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection3Para1": "No location data, no contacts, no payment data. No ads are shown and no data is sold.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection4Title": "4. Why we use this data",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection4Para1": "• To provide the service (account, sheets, groups, syncing with your GM, photos, notifications you enable): this is necessary to perform the service you use.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection4Para2": "• To improve the app (usage statistics): legitimate interest in understanding which features are used. You can opt out at any time from Profile > Privacy & data > Share my usage data.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection4Para3": "• To fix the bugs you report to us.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Title": "5. Who your data is shared with",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para1": "With other users, only at your own initiative: the GM and members of the stories or groups you join see the characters you attach to them; if you create a sheet-sharing link, anyone with that link can view the sheet read-only, until you disable it.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para2": "With our technical service providers, who process data on our behalf:",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para3": "• Supabase — hosting of the database, authentication and photos.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para4": "• Google Firebase — sending notifications (Firebase Cloud Messaging) and usage statistics (Firebase Analytics).",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para5": "• Google Firebase Crashlytics — crash reports (technical error traces and information about your device), collected systematically to keep the app stable. Unlike usage statistics (Firebase Analytics/PostHog, see above), this collection cannot be disabled from the app: our legitimate interest in diagnosing and fixing app crashes prevails here.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para6": "• PostHog (hosted in the European Union) — usage statistics.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para7": "• GitHub — tracking of reported bugs: the content of a report (title, description, severity, version, platform) is published as a ticket in a public repository, without your email address or name. Please don't include any personal information in it.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para8": "• Resend — sending transactional emails (account confirmation, password reset).",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para9": "• Vercel — hosting of the nexus-jdr.app website.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection5Para10": "Some of these providers may process data outside the European Union; these transfers are governed by the safeguards required by the GDPR (European Commission standard contractual clauses or the EU–US Data Privacy Framework).",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection6Title": "6. Retention period",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection6Para1": "• Account, game content and photos: for as long as your account exists. They are permanently deleted as soon as you delete your account.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection6Para2": "• Usage statistics: kept in pseudonymous form, unlinked from your account, for the retention period set in the measurement tools.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection6Para3": "• Bug reports: for as long as needed to process them.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection7Title": "7. Your rights",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection7Para1": "Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, port, object to and restrict the processing of your data. Directly from the app:",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection7Para2": "• Export your data: Profile > Privacy & data > Export my data.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection7Para3": "• Delete your account and all your data: Profile > Privacy & data > Delete my account.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection7Para4": "• Disable usage statistics: Profile > Privacy & data.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection7Para5": "• Disable notifications: in the app's or your phone's notification settings.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection7Para6": "For any other request, write to support@nexus-jdr.app. You can also file a complaint with the CNIL (www.cnil.fr).",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection8Title": "8. Security",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection8Para1": "Exchanges with our servers are encrypted (HTTPS). Access to your data is protected by your account's authentication and by access rules that prevent any other user from reading or modifying what you don't share.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection9Title": "9. Changes to this policy",
  "profilePrivacyPolicySection9Para1": "This policy may evolve along with the application. The last update date appears at the bottom of this screen; in case of a significant change, you will be notified in the app.",
  "profilePrivacyPolicyLastUpdated": "Last updated: November 1, 2026",

